      "created_at": "2015-10-22T01:13:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I do see their point. &nbsp;While you provide the codes for free, there is nothing in the code of the app that requires you to do so. &nbsp;If, at a later date, you decided to start charging for codes (which we know you wouldn't, but you could) then you could do so without Apple knowing about it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It's a bummer that it had to delay the multiplayer release, though. &nbsp;</p>",
